      <td class=\"point\">说明文语言特点</td>\n            <td>准确、严密、科学；生动形象或平实。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">说明文结构</td>\n            <td>并列式、递进式、总分式。</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section tight\">\n      <h2>9．议论文知识</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"point\">要　点</th>\n            <th>内　容</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">议论文的概念</td>\n            <td>通过摆事实、讲道理来直接表达作者的见解和主张的一种文体。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">议论文三要素</td>\n            <td>论点、论据、论证。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">论据类型</td>\n            <td>事实论据、道理论据。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">论证方法</td>\n            <td>举例（事例）论证、道理论证、引用论证、对比（正反对比）论证、比喻论证。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point\">议论文的结构</td>\n            <td>总分总、总分、分总（分的部分常常有并列式和递进式）。</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <h2>10．修辞的类型及作用</h2>\n      <table class=\"small-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"point-wide\">修辞手法</th>\n            <th>作　用</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point-wide\">比喻</td>\n            <td>使概括的东西形象化；使抽象的事物具体化；使深奥的道理浅显化。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"point-wide\">拟人</td>\n            <td>赋予事物人的形态和情感，描写生动形象，表意丰富。</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">知 识 · 3 · 方 法</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">\n      <div class=\"mark\">♥</div>\n      <strong>@Happy</strong>\n      <span>From 小红书</span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
